  "description": "Erection of a single-storey rear extension, single-storey front porch and the associated reconfiguration of internal room layouts at GF and FF. To include the addition of 1Nr small side window at GF, reconfiguration of 2Nr rear windows at FF and addition of 3Nr roof velux windows. Associated new bike & bin storage.",
